        <mxCell id="boundary" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;white-space:normal;&quot;&gt;Adjacent processes use dashed borders and retain their level 0 numbers; they are not new external entities. Answer selection and countdown run in the access application; there is no invented per-answer Hub route. Offline completion is QUEUED_FOR_SYNC until delivered. Validation: submitted_at - started_at &amp;lt;= duration + 60 s. Client chat is unmounted during an active attempt; the Hub independently enforces the AI rejection. Remote countdown uses the fetched Hub anchor. Timing-anchor precedence is an ASK LEAD item in the section text.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1" kind="note">
